      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Found by nat eval: the agent was confirming a 2-report\nincident and announcing subscribers would be notified,\nwith the threshold set to 3. Confirmation unlocks alerts,\nwhich makes this the same class of bug as the original.",
      "originalText": "Found by nat eval: the agent was confirming a 2-report\nincident and announcing subscribers would be notified,\nwith the threshold set to 3. Confirmation unlocks alerts,\nwhich makes this the same class of bug as the original.",
